== Trivia ==
* The Converter is a reference to a [[wikipedia:Converter|converter]], a device or system that changes the form of something.
* According to Edmund via the Four Souls Isaac lore stream, the Converter's sprite was originally supposed to be similar to an adapter that converted US-standard power plugs for UK-standard power outlets, then he "just threw some wires on it."<ref>https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ?t=5648</ref>
* The Converter can be seen as an opposite to {{i|Guppy's Paw}}. Where the Converter takes two Soul or Black Hearts to form a Heart container (or just one Soul or Black Heart as of ''Repentance''), Guppy's Paw takes one Heart container to form three Soul Hearts. Additionally, their flavor texts are similar.

